{"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Verifier asks with an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp:\/\/"},{"type":"text","text":" link, as a QR code or a link on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its page. Register the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp"},{"type":"text","text":" URL scheme in the app’s Info.plist so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"links open the app, and hand the link to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startPresentation(request:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". It fetches the Verifier’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signed request, checks its certificate against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/verifierRoots","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and finds the credentials that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can answer it. A request from a Verifier the wallet doesn’t trust"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/untrustedVerifier","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" before anything is shown."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" it returns says:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"who is asking: ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/verifier-swift.property","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", its name, and its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Registration"},{"text":" when a registrar the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wallet trusts ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/registrarRoots"},{"type":"text","text":") registered it,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with its purpose and the claims it’s registered to ask for;"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"what it asks for: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/queries","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", each with the held","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credentials that can answer it, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/credentialSets","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the request’s alternatives."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Present","type":"heading","text":"Present"},{"code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Answers a request link: `confirm` shows the holder who is asking and","\/\/\/ what sharing would disclose, and returns whether they agree. Returns","\/\/\/ where to send the browser, when the Verifier asks.","func present(requestLink: String, wallet: Wallet,","             confirm: (Presentation, [Presentation.Disclosure]) async -> Bool) async throws -> URL? {","    let presentation = try await wallet.startPresentation(request: requestLink)","    guard presentation.isAnswerable else {","        return try await presentation.decline().redirectURI","    }","    let selection = try await presentation.defaultSelection()","    let disclosures = try await presentation.preview(selection: selection)","    guard await confirm(presentation, disclosures) else {","        return try await presentation.decline().redirectURI","    }","    \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks for it.","    return try await presentation.respond(selection: selection).redirectURI","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/defaultSelection()"},{"type":"text","text":" picks the first credential that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"answers each query, and the first answerable option of each credential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set. To let the holder choose, build a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Selection"},{"type":"text","text":" from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each query’s "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" instead: a query that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes one credential gets exactly one. The wallet presents exactly the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"selection, after checking it answers the request"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/invalidSelection"},{"type":"text","text":" otherwise), and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/preview(selection:)"},{"type":"text","text":" says what it would disclose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without signing or sending anything: show that before the holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"agrees."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Open "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Presented\/redirectURI"},{"type":"text","text":", when the Verifier sends"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one, in the browser the request came from: it’s how a same-device"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"flow returns to the Verifier’s page."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Show what’s being asked beyond a registration","anchor":"Show-whats-being-asked-beyond-a-registration"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For a Verifier with a verified registration, each query’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/unregistered"},{"type":"text","text":" lists the claims it asks for beyond"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what it’s registered to request, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/unregisteredAll"},{"type":"text","text":" whether it asks for every claim."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Nothing is refused for them: show them, and let the holder decide."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Keep presentations unlinkable","anchor":"Keep-presentations-unlinkable"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each presentation uses a copy of the credential, bound to its own key,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so two Verifiers can’t link the holder’s presentations by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential. "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/copyPolicy-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":" chooses which copy:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/CopyPolicy-swift.enum\/perPresentation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", the default: a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"copy no Verifier has seen, every time.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/CopyPolicy-swift.enum\/perVerifier","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": the copy a Verifier","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has seen before, so it can recognize a returning holder, and an unused","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one for a new Verifier.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once every copy is used, one is reused. A candidate’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere"},{"type":"text","text":" says whether presenting it now would"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hand this Verifier a copy another has seen: warn the holder, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refresh the credential ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/refreshCredential(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":") when its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/copiesLeft"},{"type":"text","text":" reaches zero."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"When delivery is uncertain","anchor":"When-delivery-is-uncertain"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If sending the response fails in a way that leaves it unknown whether"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Verifier received it, "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/respond(selection:)"},{"type":"text","text":" throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/deliveryUnknown"},{"type":"text","text":" and doesn’t send it again: the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder should check with the Verifier before sharing again."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"title":"Presenting from a link","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/RequestLink"],"title":"Presenting from a link","generated":true,"anchor":"Presenting-from-a-link"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingfromalink"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer a Verifier’s OpenID4VP request: show who is asking and what,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"let 